			"widgets_values":[
				"[Shot 1] Live-action, a medium-wide shot frames a young Chinese woman in her mid-20s with long straight black hair, wearing a light-pink crewneck sweater, seated at a clean white vanity desk inside a modern live-streaming room. Ring lights and soft LED panels create warm, even illumination. Behind her, a shelf holds neatly arranged skincare bottles, a small potted plant, and a digital screen displaying \"LIVE\". On the desk in front of her sits a rose-gold serum bottle and a matching cream jar. She gestures toward the serum bottle with her right hand and says in a clear, energetic young female voice (S1): <d>[中文] 姐妹们，今天给你们安利一款精华！</d> Her expression is bright and confident as she makes direct eye contact with the camera.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the camera cuts to a close-up of the woman's face as she picks up the serum bottle and applies a single drop to her left cheek, gently patting it in with her fingertip. She smiles and continues speaking: <d>[中文] 质地超级清爽，吸收也很快。</d> The serum bottle is visible in the lower frame, rose-gold cap catching the ring-light reflection.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the camera cuts to a static product hero shot: the rose-gold serum bottle stands centered on a white surface, flanked by the matching cream jar and a small sprig of eucalyptus. Soft studio lighting highlights the product label. The woman's voice continues over the shot as narration: <d>[中文] 点击左下角，今天直播间专属优惠！</d>\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft studio room tone fills the live-streaming set throughout. The woman's voice is the dominant audio layer, close and clear with natural breath sounds. Gentle skin-contact sounds when the serum is applied to the cheek. A faint tap of the serum bottle being set back on the desk.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nAn upbeat, bright electronic pop track at a moderate tempo (around 110 BPM), with a synthetic pad layer and light percussive groove. The music stays low in the mix beneath the spoken dialogue and fades slightly during vocal moments, swelling subtly at the final product shot."
